OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a bright start in some
OL,6,Feastern areas, heavy rain and
OL,7,Fstrengthening winds quickly sweeping
OL,8,Feast as Storm Boelo arrives. Heaviest
OL,9,Fof the rain in the west and north,
OL,10,Fwith gales developing for many with
OL,11,Fdamaging winds possible further north.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMuch of the rain clears the
OL,14,Fsoutheast through the night with some
OL,15,Fheavy showers continuing in the north
OL,16,Fwith Storm Boelo slowly tracking
OL,17,Feastwards. Staying windy with gales
OL,18,Ffurther north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
