OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStrong winds remain for many
OL,6,Fwith gales in the northeast. Slowly
OL,7,Feasing through the day as Storm Boelo
OL,8,Fmoves off. Sunny spells in the south
OL,9,Fwith showers in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
